      "message": "build: respect CMAKE_INSTALL_LIBEXECDIR in the bitcoin launcher\n\ninstall_binary_component(... INTERNAL) installs bitcoin-node, bitcoin-gui,\nbitcoin-chainstate and the test and bench executables to\nCMAKE_INSTALL_LIBEXECDIR, but the bitcoin launcher looked for them in a\nhardcoded libexec directory next to its own bin directory. Installations\nconfigured with any other value, such as the -DCMAKE_INSTALL_LIBEXECDIR=lib\nused by Arch Linux, could not run them:\n\n  $ /usr/bin/bitcoin -m node --version\n  Error: execvp failed to execute '/usr/bin/bitcoin-node': No such file or\n  directory\n\nCompile the launcher with the configured directory so the two always agree.\n\nCo-authored-by: riba2534 <riba2534@qq.com>",
