      "commit_url": null,
      "created_at": null,
      "html_url": "https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/commit/08a75622107e0a84ab2d36be988cdb467f2ec8a7",
      "tree": {
        "sha": "0b5c489c8d0eadf1ee070a2ce6d3851710f8136e",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bitcoin/bitcoin/git/trees/0b5c489c8d0eadf1ee070a2ce6d3851710f8136e"
      },
      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "payload": "tree 0b5c489c8d0eadf1ee070a2ce6d3851710f8136e\nparent ea99f081f4d87a3cb767897ca4a3afcb4b24dce0\nauthor Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com> 1787692205 +0000\ncommitter Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com> 1787692205 +0000\n\ntest: check the launcher finds executables in CMAKE_INSTALL_LIBEXECDIR\n\nThe existing checks cannot tell which directory the launcher searched,\nbecause the build tree puts every executable next to it. Emulate an install\ntree instead, so the bin/ -> libexec lookup is the only way to find the\nexecutable being invoked, and check that no other directory is searched.\n\nCMAKE_INSTALL_LIBEXECDIR is exported through test/config.ini. GNUInstallDirs\nhas to be included in test/CMakeLists.txt because config.ini is generated\nbefore src/, which is where the module is included today.\n\nCo-authored-by: riba2534 <riba2534@qq.com>\n",
        "signature": "-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg+qImwGMCy/grKZ50VxRHz3VfWW\nAL3QNbzIy2Nwcn+nQAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQNZ69Y/T8drnVG6HLxkVb0lQk5PCgv2yTHbPuBQ9DAFi4X0jc9F6M8A6Oc/rZ4ZfOy\nrJZ+EoNfHadEXlW9WXuwA=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----"
